# Files under `assets/` that are not shipped to pub.dev.
#
# A `.pubignore` file overrides the `.gitignore` rules for the directory it is
# placed in, so this file only affects `assets/`: the files below stay in git,
# but are left out of the published package archive.
#
# `assets/svg/` (declared in pubspec.yaml, used at runtime) is published as
# usual; `assets/svg_hatscripts/` is the pristine upstream copy that is only
# used while curating `assets/svg/`, see CONTRIBUTING.md.
svg_hatscripts/
